===Speak with the hotel bellboy{{subst:void|<!--103020203-->}}===
{{Mission Description|type=trailblaze|location=Gallery of Thoughts|update|As you touch the frame, you are pulled in by an irresistible force, coming to a "World Within the Painting"... No, this is actually just another area of the Dreamscape, a very long corridor.<br />The hotel bellboy Misha is awaiting you here. It seems he wishes to speak with you.}}
{{Dialogue Start}}
:<!--1-second delay-->
:'''Misha:''' Ah, you're here! Wonderful!
:'''Misha:''' Oh, I... I thought you wouldn't notice me...
;(По прибытии на место)

;(По прибытии на место)
----
:'''Misha:''' Welcome to the Gallery of Thoughts! You can think of this as the entrance to the Golden Hour. I'm here to provide guidance to our guests.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} We meet again.
::'''Misha:''' Huh, you remember me? I'm so glad.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} This whole place looks weird.
:'''Misha:''' This is a temporary interchange, so it looks a little rundown... The Reverie in the dreamscape is currently undergoing a revamp.
:'''Misha:''' I apologize for any unpleasantness in your stay... but if you enter the Golden Hour, I'm sure all your troubles will dissipate in an instant!
:{{Диалог|Разговор}} What happened to The Reverie?
::'''Misha:''' You're asking about The Reverie in the dreamscape, right? I'm not sure exactly either, I'm sorry...
:;(Return to previous option selection)
:{{Диалог|Разговор}} What is "Golden Hour?"
::'''Misha:''' You've perhaps read about it in your Dreamscape Pass, but I can explain one more time!
::'''Misha:''' Golden Hour is one of the twelve dreamscapes in Penacony, and its time coincides with midnight. Here, the dream's time is forever stuck in the moment before midnight. Tomorrow will not come, and this night of revelry will never end...
::'''Misha:''' ...Ah, but that doesn't mean that time has stopped in the dream. To avoid any physical or mental burden on guests, time in the dream has been synced with reality's, so don't worry!
:;(Return to previous option selection)
:{{Диалог|Разговор}} I just picked up a note...
::'''Misha:''' Note? Did you find it in the room?
::'''Misha:''' Ah... It wasn't trash left behind by the previous guest, was it...?
::'''Misha:''' It was my mistake &mdash; I failed to tidy up properly, and caused an inconvenience for you... I'm truly sorry!
:;(Return to previous option selection)
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} How do I get to Golden Hour?
::'''Misha:''' You just go right through that door to reach Golden Hour. I wish you an unforgettable dream!
