===Go to Penacony: The Golden Hour{{subst:void|<!--103020204-->}}===
{{Mission Description|type=trailblaze|location=Gallery of Thoughts|update|Having heard Misha's explanation, you come to understand that the Reverie hotel within the dream is under maintenance and all guests must therefore pass through a temporary transfer station in order to reach Golden Hour. This is the true nature of the room you were just in.<br />Now, you need only touch the other picture frame to finally enter Penacony.}}
{{Dialogue Start}}


;(Talk to Misha)
:'''Misha:''' Right through that doorway is Golden Hour. If you've any other questions, I'm more than happy to answer them!
:{{Диалог|Разговор}} What happened to The Reverie?
::'''Misha:''' You're asking about The Reverie in the dreamscape, right? I'm not sure exactly either, I'm sorry...
:;(Return to previous option selection)
:{{Диалог|Разговор}} What is "Golden Hour?"
::'''Misha:''' You've perhaps read about it in your Dreamscape Pass, but I can explain one more time!
::'''Misha:''' Golden Hour is one of the twelve dreamscapes in Penacony, and its time coincides with midnight. Here, the dream's time is forever stuck in the moment before midnight. Tomorrow will not come, and this night of revelry will never end...
::'''Misha:''' ...Ah, but that doesn't mean that time has stopped in the dream. To avoid any physical or mental burden on guests, time in the dream has been synced with reality's, so don't worry!
:;(Return to previous option selection)
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} I've nothing else to ask, thank you.
::'''Misha:''' I wish you unforgettable dreams in Penacony!
;(По прибытии на место)

;(По прибытии на место)
:'''(Trailblazer):''' (Behind this door is the real Penacony... I'm looking forward to it.)
{{Dialogue End}}

